continuous cycle of learning and sharing, vital for the evolution of music itself, and I can only imagine the joy your participants experienced during those moments. Encouraging this dynamic exchange is essential, as it keeps the spirit of music alive and ever-evolving, reflecting the ongoing dialogue between cultures.\", \"source_role\": \"assistant\", \"source_message_indices\": [178]}]}"}], "logical_call_index": 2, "response_format": "plain", "input_tokens_local": 6138, "output_token_reserve": 4096, "input_margin": 256, "token_count_is_estimate": true, "token_estimator_id": "regex_or_utf8_bytes_div3_v2", "tokenizer_id": null, "token_accounting_note": "Evidence wire JSON estimate; not the deployed model tokenizer", "raw_output": "{\"units\": [{\"unit_id\": \"u1\", \"assessments\": [{\"span_ids\": [\"s1\"], \"node_id\": \"answer\", \"kind\": \"explicit\", \"stance\": \"support\", \"claim\": \"Scripted source-ID fixture: Conversation message indices 168\\u2013169 (zero-based chronological observation order\", \"entity_scope\": \"scripted protocol fixture only\", \"event_time\": null, \"time_span_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"Fixture protocol; no semantic accuracy claim\"}], \"irrelevance_reason\": \"\"}, {\"unit_id\": \"u2\", \"assessments\": [{\"span_ids\": [\"s2\"], \"node_id\": \"answer\", \"kind\": \"explicit\", \"stance\": \"support\", \"claim\": \"Scripted source-ID fixture: User:\\n\", \"entity_scope\": \"scripted protocol fixture only\", \"event_time\": null, \"time_span_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"Fixture protocol; no semantic accuracy claim\"}], \"irrelevance_reason\": \"\"}, {\"unit_id\": \"u3\", \"assessments\": [{\"span_ids\": [\"s3\"], \"node_id\": \"answer\", \"kind\": \"explicit\", \"stance\": \"support\", \"claim\": \"Scripted source-ID fixture: User: I found that my reviews were often criticized for not being objective, whi\", \"entity_scope\": \"scripted protocol fixture only\", \"event_time\": null, \"time_span_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"Fixture protocol; 