how these instruments can tell stories that resonate through generations. \", \"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [181]}, {\"id\": \"s56\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:f434a4e7ce4b75bd35052b32bad25d48fb4db67168e9c7043564a6960b8fa399\", \"start\": 429, \"end\": 791, \"text\": \"For instance, the use of the sitar in Indian classical music is not just about creating beautiful melodies; it carries with it a rich history and a deep connection to spiritual practices. I also found it fascinating how different genres, such as jazz and folk, borrow elements from one another, creating unique fusions that reflect cultural exchanges over time. \", \"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [181]}, {\"id\": \"s57\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:f434a4e7ce4b75bd35052b32bad25d48fb4db67168e9c7043564a6960b8fa399\", \"start\": 791, \"end\": 965, \"text\": \"This interconnectedness of music only deepens my appreciation for how it serves as a universal language that transcends boundaries and speaks to the core of human experience.\", \"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [181]}, {\"id\": \"s58\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:02ce04a53ad7cff2c5cd4e48103362013595aa53ea145d56253c380a37039d54\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 99, \"text\": \"Conversation message indices 47–47 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\", \"source_role\": \"unknown\", \"source_message_indices\": []}, {\"id\": \"s59\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:02ce04a53ad7cff2c5cd4e48103362013595aa53ea145d56253c380a37039d54\", \"start\": 99, \"end\": 107, \"text\": \"System:\\n\", \"source_role\": \"unknown\", \"source_message_indices\": []}]}"}], "logical_call_index": 4, "response_format": "plain", "input_tokens_local": 5904, "output_token_reserve": 4096, "input_margin": 256, "token_count_is_estimate": true, "token_estimator_id": "regex_or_utf8_bytes_div3_v2", "tokenizer_id": null, "token_accounting_note": "Evidence wire JSON estimate; not the 